    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "As spring weather made the journey more feasible, over eight thousand migrants facing perilous journeys were apprehended by the enforcement arm tasked with border security, marking a measurable increase in crossings. Yet year-to-date numbers remain near multi-decade lows under policies that restrict access to asylum and safety, leaving the affected population in a system that prioritizes restriction over protection.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "center": "who-1",
        "center_kind": "who",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 0
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "A window of opportunity created by the changing season contributed to a border activity metric showing increased apprehensions, but the underlying enforcement measures resulting in historically low crossing numbers reflect policies that prioritize restriction. This system, overseen by government officials deadlocked on funding, impacts people seeking safety or opportunity along the international boundary.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "result-0",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "center": "result-0",
        "center_kind": "result",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 1
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.82
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "While observers tracking border trends note a rise in the number of people intercepted, the larger picture reveals a legislative impasse on enforcement funding. This political stalemate delaying support for border operations leaves officials responsible for policy decisions deadlocked, with no resolution for individuals in vulnerable circumstances caught in limbo.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
